{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fairground Online \u2013 Your Ultimate Ride Simulator!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the thrilling world of amusement rides like never before! In <i>Fairground Online</i>, you control realistic attractions, create unforgettable experiences, and immerse yourself in a vibrant fairground world \u2013 all in online multiplayer with other players.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer:</strong> Enjoy the fair with friends or players from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Ride Physics and Controls:</strong> Operate each ride with authentic control panels \u2013 from speed and rotation to special effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lighting Control:</strong> Customize the lighting of your rides and create stunning light shows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Music and Jingle Control:</strong> Choose music and announcements to create the perfect atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day-Night Cycle:</strong> Experience the fair during the day and night \u2013 each time of day offers a unique ambiance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the most exciting rides \u2013 alone or with friends. The fairground is waiting for you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3310530?t=1756577981","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3310530?t=1756577981","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/c38f19eea2a090eb37ef955c0f9cef0ea0b36e2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756577981","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3310530/c38f19eea2a090eb37ef955c0f9cef0ea0b36e2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756577981","categories":[{"description":"Singl